{"id":"ah","lemma":"ah","pos":"intj","rank":202,"glosses":["ah (expression of relief, realization, awe)","ah (expression of woe, grief)"],"ipa":"/ˈa/","examples":[{"text":"Ah, eso está mucho mejor.","en":"Ah, that's much better.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636752","words":[null,{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"better"}]},{"text":"Ah, ya sé dónde estamos.","en":"Oh, I know where we are now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831328","words":[null,{"g":"now"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"}]},{"text":"¡Ah! ¡Que barato!","en":"Wow! That's cheap!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798932","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"cheap"}]},{"text":"Ah, entiendo.","en":"Oh, I got it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637229","words":[null,{"g":"to understand","l":"entender"}]},{"text":"\"Ah\" es una interjección.","en":"\"Ah\" is an interjection.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}